  "title": "Febe Viewport Navigation Pan Zoom Orbit",
  "status": "AUTOMATED_TARGET_VALIDATED_MANUAL_UI_PENDING",
  "summary": "Orbit, orthographic pan, wheel zoom-to-cursor and title maximize already existed. Added Zoom Extents/Selected, Home/Center, a captured Shift-pan decision and the Camera fit/center primitives, with explicit tests for orbit/pan ownership and 10x20x30 fitting.",
  "audit_result": {
    "existing_implementation": "PARTIAL",
    "gaps_found": [
      "No Zoom Extents or Zoom Selected command.",
      "No Home or Center view reset command.",
      "Shift+right pan relied on the modifier state of a later frame; a Shift-pan could become an orbit.",
      "No camera fit primitive or explicit 10x20x30 fit test."
    ],
    "gaps_closed": "all"
  },
  "code_changes": [
    "crates/om9-scene/src/camera.rs: Camera::fit_bounds and Camera::center_at",
    "crates/om9-scene/src/workspace.rs: Workspace::default_camera/default_cplane and initial-view refactor",
    "crates/om9-app/src/session.rs: world bounds, zoom_extents/zoom_selected, view_home/view_center, view command aliases/dispatch",
    "crates/om9-app/src/ui.rs: ZoomExtents/ZoomSelected/Home/Center UI routing and aspect-aware fits",
    "crates/om9-app/src/navigation.rs: GestureSession.pan captured at press",
    "crates/om9-scene/tests/camera_fit.rs, crates/om9-app/tests/navigation_commands.rs, crates/om9-app/tests/navigation_drag.rs"
  ],
